---
title: Toast
description: Toast notifications with customizable types.
show_title: true
show_description: true
hide_table_of_contents: true
show_source: true
---

<p class="lead mx-3 my-4">Compare colors, close a notification and check the close control with the keyboard.</p>
<h2 class="h4 mx-3 mt-4">Standard variants</h2>

{% set types = ['primary', 'secondary', 'success', 'danger', 'warning', 'info', 'light', 'dark'] %}
{% for type in types %}
    <twig:block-toast
        class="my-2"
        type="{{ type }}"
        title="Toast type: {{ type }}"
        content="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur <a href='https://www.example.com/' target='_blank'>adipiscing elit.</a>"
        time="5 mins ago"
    />
{% endfor %}


<h2 class="h4 mx-3 mt-5">Long content and layout checks</h2>
<twig:block-toast class="container my-4" type="warning" title="Review the synchronization settings for all companies" time="Just now" content="This longer notification should wrap without covering the close control. Use the visible close button or reach it with the keyboard." />
